  "statement": "# Ember & Tide — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nSwitch or balance two contrasting elemental states to traverse encounters, solve spatial problems, and complete a bounded journey.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA compact 2D action-puzzle game where both elemental states materially affect play, with failure/recovery and a final ending.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the exact state rules, encounter layout, progression, hazards, and presentation.\n"
